<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Swerve!</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Catra turns back to see them steering wonkily, their motorbike driving in a zigzag despite its speed. &lt;em&gt;A drunk biker who isnâ€™t paying attention to the traffic lights.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It surges forward and straight past Catra and right towards Glimmer whoâ€™s still crossing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Time suddenly slows for Catra and the first thing that comes to her mind is; what would Adora do?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Catra braces as she revs her engine, speeding onto the road and &lt;em&gt;just&lt;/em&gt; fast enough to shove Glimmer off the path of the motorbiker. Catra has to swerve to avoid hitting a car. Itâ€™s too easy to lose balance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Â &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;
  &lt;em&gt;Oh no.&lt;/em&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Â &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;After a stressful day involving Catra getting fired and Adora contacting her, Catra takes her motorbike out for a ride to relieve her anger. When Catra sees Glimmer about to be run over, Catra narrowly saves her and ends up hospitalised as a result.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Parallels to three She-Ra episodes : Corridors, Save the Cat and Taking control&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>dfs (dead_frog)</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
